      "value": "Thank you for your report!\n\nOn the 30th (last week) there was a temporary outage causing migration to fail. We have addressed the issue serverside and will issue an additional fix in the next version of the VCC.\n\nIf you're still experiencing issues with migration, please let us know and we'll look into it.\n\nHave a nice week!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
