  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-11-29T23:59:20.017Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Migrate project does not finish with VCC 1.0.4 or 1.0.3.\n\nMigrating almost empty world or avatar project took more than one hour.\n\nWith VCC 1.0.2 or vpm CLI 0.1.12, successfully migrated quickly.\n\n**Workaround**\n\nYou can use [VCC 1.0.2](https://vcc.docs.vrchat.com/news/release-1.0.2) or [vpm CLI](https://vcc.docs.vrchat.com/vpm/cli). AFAIK, it works.\n\n**Steps to Reproduce**\n\n 1. create empty 3d project with Unity Hub\n\n 2. import VRCSDK World or Avatar 2022.10.27.00.35.\n\n 3. If you added Word SDK\n\n> 3.1. create new scene\n\n> 3.2. add prefab instance of VRCWorld.\n\n 4. save and close project.\n\n 5. add the project to VCC\n\n 6. click Migrate in VCC\n\n**Expected Behavior**\n\nMigrate project finishes in reasonable time. \n\nWith vpm CLI 0.1.12, it finishes within one minute.\n\n**Actual Behavior**\n\nMigrate project does not finish for more than one hour.\n\nThere's nothing let us migrating project is in progress so it looks migrate process is not started.",
